[I] View for Pod::POM that outputs reStructuredText

[T] This module outputs reStructuredText that is expected to be used with
[T] Sphinx. Verbatim sections (indented paragraphs) in the POD will be output
[T] with syntax highlighting for Perl code by default. See "POD commands
[T] specifically for reStructuredText" for how to change this for a particular
[T] block.

[U] https://metacpan.org/dist/Pod-POM-View-Restructured

